            "review_text": "Foodlover\n1 contribution\n0\nWe went in a group and the buffet costed 299k Dong per pax. There was no precooked food although they call it a buffet.\nFeb 2019 • Friends\nWe went there in a group and the buffet costed 299k VND per pax. There was no precooked food although they call it a buffet. The service was slow and the portion of food was small. Therefore we did not eat much. We paid a few million VND but the actual value of the food was perhaps only 1/10 of the amount we paid. What a rip-off !!! The only positive comment I have is that their staff put on a big smile.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 2, 2019",
